#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.py:docstring of pyvista_js.mesh.PolyData.shrink:3
msgid "This filter shrinks the individual cells of a mesh towards their centroids, producing visual separation between adjacent cells. It mirrors the PyVista ``shrink`` filter API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.py:docstring of pyvista_js.mesh.PolyData.shrink:9
msgid "The shrink is computed in JavaScript at render time by iterating over the cell array from the vtk.js source, moving each vertex toward its cell's centroid. ``vtk.js`` does not include ``vtkShrinkFilter``, so this filter is implemented as a custom JavaScript pass."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.py:docstring of pyvista_js.mesh.PolyData.shrink:15
msgid "The factor to shrink each cell by, between 0 and 1. A value of 1.0 produces no change; lower values produce more shrinkage. Default is 0.8."
msgstr ""

